      47.85,
      384.13,
      539.94,
      467.2
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 20 (4) (b) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Dr. WijayadasaRajapaksa, Minister of Higher Education and Cultural Affairs, on being satisfied that the administration of the affairs ofthe Postgraduate Institute of Archeology have been seriously dislocated and that the authorities of the said Institute havefailed to restore normal conditions, do by this Order, appoint Professor Prishantha Gunawardhana to be the CompetentAuthority with effect from January 24, 2018 for the purpose of exercising, performing and discharging in lieu of Directorof Postgraduate Institute of Archeology, any power, duty or function which has been conferred or imposed on, or assignedto the said Director under the said Act, or any Order, Ordinance, Statute, By- Law, Regulation or Rule made thereunder.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
